{
  "_comment": "The program editor (FTR-APP-008): its tabs in the musician's order (PLAN-APP-006), the assistant's proposal of 2026-10-15 and 2026-10-16, data the owner can change (TASK-APP-002). Parameter names are those of mcp::ParameterCatalogue::standard(). [RQ-APP-093, RQ-APP-094, RQ-APP-095, ADR-APP-004 (DEC-APP-024, DEC-APP-027, DEC-APP-030, DEC-APP-031, DEC-APP-033, DEC-APP-035), TASK-APP-045, TASK-APP-046, TASK-APP-048, TASK-APP-049]",
